{"id":"825f4a87fb2f99c8","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-boollattice.md","title":"Boolean-function algebra","display":"df-boollattice — Boolean-function algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-boollattice","aliases":["27-df-boollattice"],"display":"df-boollattice — Boolean-function algebra","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]","[[27-df-boolop]]","[[27-df-constfunc]]"],"local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-boollattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-boollattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boollattice — Boolean-function algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35eab4f22873ea23\" href=\"?note=35eab4f22873ea23\" title=\"27-df-constfunc\">27-df-constfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f,g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg\">\\(\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg\\)</span> (pointwise operations, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{0}_n,\\mathbf{1}_n\">\\(\\mathbf{0}_n,\\mathbf{1}_n\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35eab4f22873ea23\" href=\"?note=35eab4f22873ea23\" title=\"27-df-constfunc\">27-df-constfunc</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\leq g\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\leq g(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\leq g\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\leq g(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_n\\coloneqq\\left(\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\\\\n\\{(f,g)\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n^2\\mid f\\leq g\\},\\\\\n\\{((f,g),f\\wedge g)\\mid f,g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\},\\\\\n\\{((f,g),f\\vee g)\\mid f,g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\},\\\\\n\\{(f,\\neg f)\\mid f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf0_n,\\mathbf1_n\n\\end{gathered}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B_n\\coloneqq\\left(\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\\\\n\\{(f,g)\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n^2\\mid f\\leq g\\},\\\\\n\\{((f,g),f\\wedge g)\\mid f,g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\},\\\\\n\\{((f,g),f\\vee g)\\mid f,g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\},\\\\\n\\{(f,\\neg f)\\mid f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf0_n,\\mathbf1_n\n\\end{gathered}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{B}_n\">\\(\\mathcal{B}_n\\)</span> is a finite Boolean algebra under pointwise operations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolop]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-constfunc","status":"resolved","id":"35eab4f22873ea23","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-constfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f,g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$（see [[27-df-boolfunc]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg$ (pointwise operations, see [[27-df-boolop]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-constfunc","status":"resolved","id":"35eab4f22873ea23","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{0}_n,\\mathbf{1}_n$ (see [[27-df-constfunc]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f,g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{0}_n,\\mathbf{1}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f\\leq g\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\leq g(x)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_n\\coloneqq\\left(\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\\\\n\\{(f,g)\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n^2\\mid f\\leq g\\},\\\\\n\\{((f,g),f\\wedge g)\\mid f,g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\},\\\\\n\\{((f,g),f\\vee g)\\mid f,g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\},\\\\\n\\{(f,\\neg f)\\mid f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf0_n,\\mathbf1_n\n\\end{gathered}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{B}_n","display":false}],"bytes":1137,"backlinks":[{"id":"fc43fd787805e1b8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ and $\\mathcal{B}_n$ (see [[27-df-boollattice]])"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-boollattice|df-boollattice — Boolean-function algebra]]"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817","11de8465f2282555","35eab4f22873ea23"]}